notes.content:
[b]Fixes:[/b]
[list]
[*] Fixed a bug that caused the flashlight to not turn on after using a battery.
[/list]

[b]Changes:[/b]
[list]
[*] Changed the balance - the difficulty has become slightly higher;
[*] Added text prompts for consumables when they are illuminated in the backpack;
[*] Removed illumination of pockets;
[*] Changed some lines in Eyeperator dialogs - now Eyeperator on the first shift reports that the courier does not get time penalties if he is in a dialog with the client or with Eyeperator;
[*] Small cosmetic changes;
[*] There is now a clock above some entryway doors;
[*] Changed the mechanics of intercoms - it is now required to press the bell button after entering the apartment to contact the client;
[*] Additional audible alarms have been added for intercoms;
[*] No more tripping over the curb. The local government utilized the budget and repaved the curb, replacing it with a smoother curb. Externally it is the same curb, but the budget has been utilized.
[/list]

Work continues on improvements and changes based on your feedback and suggestions!
